  expanded_description: "Keen Edge have a 50% chance to inflict bleeding on hit. Bleeding causes 1/16 max HP damage per turn, prevents healing, and negates the effects of stat stages. Rock and Ghost types are immune to bleeding.immune to bleeding. Multihits roll the activation chance on each hit."
}
ability {
  id: ABILITY_LIFE_STEAL
